From e9024db228932326523ab1294d8233dcfd362d3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eviden0 <Eviden0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:57:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat(ssa): add ssa-scan CLI and value-aware risk pipeline

- add a standalone ssa-scan binary and ssacmds CLI package so SSA compile / SyntaxFlow scanning builds without the AI, MITM, crawler, plugin and gRPC server trees
- carry the producing Value through ScanRuntime risk updates; report writers can render data-flow graphs without a database round trip
- add overlay file visibility helpers for incremental scans
- add embedded library loader for scans that skip builtin rule sync
- add crash-safe report publishing (temp file + rename, retained backup)
- refine struct scan options/state, sfvm value merging, and XML/freeMarker native calls
